message: If you use SharpCompute in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: SharpCompute
abstract: Write GPU compute shaders in C# and run them on Metal. A Roslyn source generator translates shader structs to the Metal Shading Language at build time; a small runtime compiles, caches and dispatches them.
